In the evening, I knock on Anitha's door.
Anitha opens the door.
She sees me and smiles happily.
"Come inside, Maya," Anitha says.
I go inside.
We sit on the sofa.
Anitha gives me a cup of hot tea.
The tea is very tasty.
We drink the tea slowly.
"How is your day today?" she asks.
I tell her about things at the office.
"The work at the office is very easy today," I say.
Anitha talks about her day.
"I am at home today," she says.
"I am reading a Malayalam book."
We talk for a long time.
I really like talking to Anitha.
Her home is always very peaceful.
After having tea, I return to my flat.
I am very happy now.
